---
import Container from '../Container.astro';
---

<section class="pb-24">
  <Container>
    <div class="bg-sand border border-stone/20 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center gap-8 md:gap-12">
      <div class="md:flex-1">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-stone font-medium">
          Strumento gratuito
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl md:text-3xl font-heading font-semibold text-midnight leading-tight">
          Quanto ti costa oggi il tempo che si perde?
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-charcoal leading-relaxed">
          Email riscritte tre volte, documenti cercati per venti minuti, report compilati a mano. Tre numeri e ottieni la cifra annuale in euro. Senza registrazione.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="md:flex-shrink-0">
        <a
          href="/calcolatore"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-gold text-midnight rounded-full px-8 py-3 font-medium hover:scale-[1.02] hover:bg-gold/90 transition-all"
        >
          Calcola il costo &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
